        "抵押贷款发放本体（Mortgage Origination Ontology）"@zh ;
    dcterms:abstract "This ontology covers a range of mortgage origination concepts, primarily in the form of controlled vocabularies that can be used to categorize aspects of a given mortgage loan." ;
